te a move to make\\nroom for {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}","msg_0538_T11R0702_00001":"Give up on learning the move\\n{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}","msg_0538_T11R0702_00002":"{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} did not learn\\n{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\\r{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} emerged from the motor.","msg_0538_T11R0702_00003":"The move {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0} will be\\nforgotten. Is that OK? {YESNO 0}","msg_0538_T11R0702_00004":"1,{PAUSE 20} 2,{PAUSE 20} and...{PAUSE 20} ...{PAUSE 20} Poof!","msg_0538_T11R0702_00005":"{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} forgot how to\\nuse {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\\rAnd...","msg_0538_T11R0702_00006":"{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} learned\\n{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}!","msg_0538_T11R0702_00007":"Which ROTOM are you choosing?\\r","msg_0538_T11R0702_00008":"An Egg can’t enter a motor.","msg_0538_T11R0702_00009":"That Pokémon can’t enter a motor.","msg_0538_T11R0702_00010":"{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} entered the motor.\\r","msg_0538_T11R0702_00011":"{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} emerged from the motor.\\r","msg_0538_T11R0702_00012":"Return which ROTOM to its\\noriginal form? {YESNO 0}","msg_0538_T11R0702_00013":"Oh? ROTOM appears as if it wants to\\nrevert to its original form.\\rWould you like to recall it from\\nthe motor? {YESNO 0}","msg_0538_T11R0702_00014":"RECALL","msg_0538_T11R0702_00015":"YES","msg_0538_T11R0702_00016":"NO","msg_0538_T11R0702_00017":"That ROTOM hasn’t entered a motor.","msg_0538_T11R0702_00018":"There was an appliance here.\\nThe one with the oddly shaped motor.","msg_0538_T11R0702_00019":"CANCEL","msg_0538_T11R0702_00020":"It’s a microwave oven.\\nIt has an odd-shaped motor on it.\\r","msg_0538_T11R0702_00021":"It’s a microwave oven.\\nIt has an odd-shaped motor on it.\\rOh? ROTOM appears as if it wants\\nto go into the motor.\\rAllow it to enter the motor? {YESNO 0}","msg_0538_T11R0702_00022":"ROTOM reluctantly gave up on entering\\nthe microwave oven’s motor...","msg_0538_T11R0702_00023":"It’s a refrigerator.\\nIt has an odd-shaped motor on it.\\r","msg_0538_T11R0702_00024":"It’s a refrigerator.\\